•	20+ years’ global experience in modern fixed wing/rotorcraft/space/eVTOL vehicle and aviation systems product lifecycle development and management, from concept definition, detailed designs, validation/verification, certification, production, and operation;  
•	Co-founded a stealth eVTOL startup with $100+M valuation funded by global venture capital; Held senior engineering/program leadership positions in various advanced tech companies for 10+ years; Built, coached and led large cross-functional teams and suppliers to deliver demonstrable results; Proven record of flawless execution in some of the toughest aerospace programs ($50M+ budget);
